            "review_title": "Review at Cāga Café & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "DENIS C\nFontenay-sous-Bois, France1491 contributions\n0\nExceptionnel Vegetarian/vegan restaurant\nJun 2024 • Friends\nI am not a vegetarian neither a vegan , my friends took me to this beautifully decorated restaurant, \nThe dishes are inspirated from all other the world from France Italy to Mexico and of course Vietnam , surprising vegan foie gras, excellent nachos with ratatouille, perfect truffle risotto ,orecchiette al pesto great , vegetarian bird nest very tasty, great wines selection, excellent price/quality , reservation recommended , will go back for sure , attentive service!\nRead more\nWritten June 2, 2024",
